[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0070","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12455","title":"Intelbras NPLUG 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Intelbras NPLUG 1.0.0.14 无线中继器存在身份认证绕过漏洞，攻击者仅需在 Cookie 中设置名为 \"admin:\" 的值即可绕过 Web 管理界面的身份验证，直接获得管理员权限访问。该漏洞源于设备对会话 Cookie 验证逻辑缺陷，未正确校验用户身份凭证。影响范围为运行该固件版本的 Intelbras NPLUG 无线中继设备。攻击条件为：目标设备 Web 管理界面暴露在网络可达范围内，无需用户交互或前置认证。利用方式为构造包含 \"admin:\" Cookie 名的 HTTP 请求直接访问管理后台，可导致设备配置被篡改、网络流量被劫持或固件被植入恶意代码。CVSS 3.0 评分 8.1（高危），向量为 AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12455"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-10T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:37:48Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 Intelbras NPLUG 无线重复器设备固件到最新支持版本，获取官方认证修复补丁；同时关闭设备 Web 管理界面远程访问功能，如需远程管理请通过VPN连接；此外应更改默认管理员密码并启用强密码策略，以防止攻击者利用 cookie 认证绕过漏洞非法访问设备控制面板。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Oct/18","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12455.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/intelbras/nplug/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-12455.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-12455.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-12455.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12455.poc","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/4cf955fbecaa77ac44d4ef96873cffa045427058/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12455.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0070.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0207","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8006","title":"Apache ActiveMQ 管理控制台跨站脚本攻击","description":"Apache ActiveMQ 5.0.0至5.15.5版本的Web管理控制台queue.jsp页面存在跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79）。由于对QueueFilter参数缺乏有效的输入过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可构造特制的恶意URL，诱使已登录的管理员用户点击，从而在目标浏览器上下文中执行任意JavaScript脚本，窃取会话凭证、篡改页面内容或发起后续攻击。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），影响范围广泛，CVSS评分6.1，危害等级中危。建议升级至5.15.6及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8006"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-10T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:04Z","remediation":"升级 Apache ActiveMQ 至 5.15.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 queue.jsp 页面 QueueFilter 参数的 XSS 过滤缺陷。如无法立即升级，可禁用 Web 管理控制台：删除或重命名 activemq-web-console 相关 WAR 包，或在配置文件中设置 jetty.xml 的 Connector 端口仅监听内网地址，避免暴露到公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://activemq.apache.org/security-advisories.data/CVE-2018-8006-announcement.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105156","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/03f91b1fb85686a848cee6b90112cf6059bd1b21b23bacaa11a962e1%40%3Cdev.activemq.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/2b5c0039197a4949f29e1e2c9441ab38d242946b966f61c110808bcc%40%3Ccommits.activemq.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/3f1e41bc9153936e065ca3094bd89ff8167ad2d39ac0b410f24382d2%40%3Cgitbox.activemq.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/a859563f05fbe7c31916b3178c2697165bd9bbf5a65d1cf62aef27d2%40%3