e,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1111","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8453","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 内核组件在处理内存对象时存在不当引用漏洞，本地低权限攻击者可通过构造恶意 Win32k 用户模式回调（如 NtUserSetWindowFNID），诱骗用户执行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，从而在内核态执行任意代码并提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10/RT 8.1 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2019 等多个主流版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2018 年 10 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8453"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-10-10T13:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 10 月安全更新，各版本对应 KB 编号为：Windows 10 Version 1809 安装 KB4464330、Version 1803/Windows Server 2016 安装 KB4462933、Windows 8.1/Windows 7 SP1 安装 KB4462921/KB4462920。通过 Windows Update 自动更新即可获取补丁。如无法立即安装，可启用 Windows Defender Exploit Guard 的 Attack Surface Reduction 规则或限制本地低权限用户运行 Win32k 回调相关程序作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞已被 CISA 纳入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议在规定期限内完成补丁部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153669/Microsoft-Windows-NtUserSetWindowFNID-Win32k-User-Callback.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105467","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041828","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8453","https://securelist.com/cve-2018-8453-used-in-targeted-attack","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8453","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47134","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8453.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/4d49d726b1fb3c9b2aca31cc43dccec4b6f94cc1/2018/CVE-2018-8453.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-8453.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2018-8453/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2018-8453/README_EN.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/31304cdc39fc95e69cc036c0a98359b4fe9d5f94/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2018-8453.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2018-8453/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2018-8453_A.yar","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8453.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8453.md","https://github.com/ze0r/cve-2018-8453-exp","https://github.com/thepwnrip/leHACK-Analysis-of-CVE-2018-8453","https://github.com/Mkv4/cve-2018-8453-exp"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0130","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18069","title":"WordPress WPML 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WPML（sitepress-multilingual-cms）插件 3.6.3 及之前版本中，process_forms 功能对 theme-localization.php 页面的 locale_file_name_ 参数（如 locale_file_name_en）缺乏充分的输入过滤与转义，导致存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。已登录认证的攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱使管理员点击，在目标浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码，窃取会话凭证或执行恶意操作。该漏洞影响 WordPress 站点上所有使用 WPML 插件的环境，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18069"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-08T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:46:44Z","remediation":"立即将 WPML（sitepress-multilingual-cms）插件升级到 4.0 或更高版本。该漏洞在 3.6.3 及之前版本中存在，升级到 4.0 后 locale_file_name_ 参数已得到正确转义处理。由于该插件已从 WordPress.org 官方仓库下架，需从 wpml.org 官网获取最新版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台移除 wp-admin/admin.php 中 theme-localization.php 页面的访问权限，或通过 .htaccess 限制对该页面的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://0x62626262.wordpress.com/2018/10/08/sitepress-multilingual-cms-plugin-unauthenticated-stored-xss/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18069.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18069.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/776c70ef3232e07089a2f49f1ecac336b827a8a1/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18069.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18069.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18069-3429.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18069-3430.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18069-3425.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18069-3426.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-18069.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2018-18069.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-18069.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0130.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0061","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11784","title":"Apache Tomcat 默认重定向漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 默认 Servlet 存在开放重定向漏洞。当用户请求目录路径（如 `/foo`）时，Tomcat 默认 Servlet 会返回重定向到目录（如 `/foo/`），在此过程中若未对用户构造的特殊 URL 进行校验，攻击者可利用该漏洞将重定向目标指向任意外部 URI。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 7.0.23 至 7.0.90、8.5.0 至 8.5.33 以及 9.0.0.M1 至 9.0.11 版本，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户点击特制 URL 即可触发重定向至攻击者控制的恶意站点，从而实施钓鱼攻击或绕过访问控制限制。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11784"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-04T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:35Z","remediation":"建议将 Apache Tomcat 升级至修复版本：7.0.91、8.5.34 或 9.0.12 及更高版本。如暂时无法升级，可在前置反向代理（Nginx/Apache httpd）中配置规则校验 Location 响应头格式，拦截重定向至外部 URI 或非法路径的请求，并将 default servlet 的目录读权限设为 readonly 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-06/msg00030.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-07/msg00056.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163456/Apache-Tomcat-9.0.0M1-Open-Redirect.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105524","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0130","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0131","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0485","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:1529","https://kc.mcafee.com/corporate/index?page=content&id=SB10284","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/1dd0a59c1295cc08ce4c9e7edae5ad2268acc9ba55adcefa0532e5ba%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/23134c9b5a23892a205dc140cdd8c9c0add233600f76b313dda6bd75%40%3Cannounce.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/343558d982879bf88ec20dbf707f8c11255f8e219e81d45c4f8d0551%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/388a323769f1dff84c9ec905455aa73fbcb20338e3c7eb131457f708%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/3d19773b4cf0377db62d1e9328bf9160bf1819f04f988315086931d7%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5c0e00fd31efc11e147bf99d0f03c00a734447d3b131ab0818644cdb%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6af47120905aa7d8fe12f42e8ff2284fb338ba141d3b77b8c7cb61b3%40%3Cdev.tomcat.