缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105314","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041621","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/coldfusion/apsb18-33.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45979/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-15961","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45979","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15961.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15961.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-15961.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-15961.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Adobe ColdFusion upload.cfm 任意文件上传漏洞 CVE-2018-15961.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-15961/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-15961.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/Adobe-ColdFusion-upload.cfm-任意文件上传漏洞-CVE-2018-15961.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15961.py","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2018/CVE-2018-15961.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2018-15961.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-15961.md","https://github.com/vah13/CVE-2018-15961","https://github.com/xbufu/CVE-2018-15961","https://github.com/orangmuda/CVE-2018-15961","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2018-15961","https://github.com/bu1xuan2/CVE-2018-15961"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0408.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0107","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16299","title":"WordPress Localize My Post插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress Localize My Post 插件 1.0 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 ajax/include.php 文件的 file 参数。未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向该参数传递 ../ 路径序列实现目录穿越，读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需任何权限，利用方式简单，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16299"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-24T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:03Z","remediation":"立即删除 WordPress 插件目录 wp-content/plugins/localize-my-post/ 彻底移除该插件，该插件已被官方下架且不再维护。如暂时无法删除，在 .htaccess 中添加 RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/localize-my-post/ajax/include\\.php - [F,L] 拒绝直接访问存在漏洞的 include.php 文件，并尽快迁移至其他本地化替代插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Sep/33","https://github.com/julianburr/wp-plugin-localizemypost/issues/1","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/149433/WordPress-Localize-My-Post-1.0-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45439/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45439","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16299.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16299.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16299.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-16299.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16299-3370.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16299-3374.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16299-3375.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16299-3371.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16299-3373.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16299.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-16299.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0104","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16283","title":"WordPress Wechat Broadcast 插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress Wechat Broadcast 插件 1.2.0 及更早版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Image.php 文件的 url 参数传入包含 ../ 的恶意路径，读取服务器上的任意文件，如 wp-config.php 等敏感配置文件。该漏洞影响所有安装了该插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击无需任何认证，利用门槛极低，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码和 Nuclei 检测模板，建议立即升级插件或移除该组件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16283"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-24T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:01Z","remediation":"立即删除或停用 Wechat Broadcast 插件（所有版本均受影响，官方已于 2018 年 10 月关闭下架且不再提供更新）。如无法立即删除，可在 Web 服务器配置中添加规则阻止对 `/wp-content/plugins/wechat-broadcast/wechat/Image.php` 的访问：Nginx 使用 `location ~ ^/wp-content/plugins/wechat-broadcast/ { deny all; }`，Apache 使用 `<DirectoryMatch \"wechat-broadcast\"> Require all denied </DirectoryMatch>`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Sep/32","https://github.com/springjk/wordpress-wechat-broadcast/issues/14","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9132","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45438/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/150202","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45438","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16283.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16283.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-16283.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16283.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-16283.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16283-3362.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16283-3364.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-16283.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-16283.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16283.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16283.yaml","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2018-16283"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0123","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17173","title":"LG SuperSign CMS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"LG SuperSign CMS 的 qsr_server/device/getThumbnail 接口中 sourceUri 参数存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求向该参数注入恶意代码，从而在服务器端执行任意命令，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 LG SuperSign EZ CMS 2.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码，攻击门槛极低。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17173"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-21T17:29:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 LG SuperSign CMS 至官方修复版本（高于 2.5），或升级 SuperSignEZ 至高于 1.3 的版本。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 9080 端口的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接；同时部署 WAF 规则拦截对 `/qsr_server/device/getThumbnail` 路径的请求，并对 `sourceUri` 参数中的命令执行特征（如 `;`、`|`、`$()` 等 shell 元字符）进行过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mamaquieroserpentester.blogspot.com/2018/09/lg-supersign-rce-to-luna-and-back-to.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152733/LG-Supersign-EZ-CMS-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45448/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46795/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45448","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17173.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17173.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/829fe97549d2c22e8071a734de23865dee1f63b6/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17173.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/lg/supersign_cms/CVE-2018-17173.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17173.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-17173.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-17173.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-17173.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-17173.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17173.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-17173.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0127","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17283","title":"Zoho ManageEngine OpManager SQL注入漏洞","description":"Zoho ManageEngine OpManager 12.3 Build 123196 之前版本中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞源于 /oputilsServlet 接口未进行身份认证，远程攻击者可直接构造恶意请求获取 API 密钥，进而通过 /api/json/device/setManaged 接口的 name 参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，导致数据库敏感信息泄露。攻击者还可利用获取的 API 密钥通过 Firewall Analyzer 的 /api/json/v2/admin/addUser 接口添加管理员账户，实现未授权访问。该漏洞无需任何权限即可远程利用，影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17283"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-21T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:37Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Zoho ManageEngine OpManager（及配套 Firewall Analyzer）升级至 12.3 Build 123196 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /oputilsServlet 接口未授权访问及 /api/json/device/setManaged 参数 SQL 注入问题。如暂时无法升级，请在防火墙或 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面将 /oputilsServlet 与 /api/json 路径的未授权外部访问阻断，限制仅内部可信网段可访问管理接口，同时排查系统是否已存在异常管理员账户并立即删除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/x-f1v3/ForCve/issues/4","https://www.manageengine.com/network-monitoring/help/read-me.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17283.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17283.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4364d39380ee5ce53a0ba00a4a1f4a27f1df9cc8/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17283.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17283.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/zohocorp/manageengine_opmanager/CVE-2018-17283.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-17283.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-17283.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-17283.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-17283.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-17283.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17283.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0126","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17254","title":"Joomla JCK Editor 6.4.4 SQL注入漏洞","description":"JCK Editor 6.4.4 组件 for Joomla! 中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，位于 jtreelink/dialogs/links.php 文件的 parent 参数。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 parent 参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而实现对后端数据库的任意查询与操作，导致敏感数据泄露、数据篡改甚至完全控制服务器。该漏洞无需任何权限或用户交互即可利用，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17254"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-20T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:36Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 JCK Editor 6.4.4 组件，该组件已停止维护且无官方补丁。如必须使用编辑器功能，替换为其他受支持的 Joomla 编辑器扩展（如 JCE、TinyMCE）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或 .htaccess 中添加规则，拦截对 /plugins/editors/jckeditor/plugins/jtreelink/dialogs/links.php 的请求，并对 parent 参数进行严格的输入过滤，禁止包含 UNION、SELECT 等 SQL 关键字。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161683/Joomla-JCK-Editor-6.4.4-SQL-Injection.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45423/","https://w