 Duplicator PHP代码注入漏洞","description":"Snap Creek Duplicator WordPress 插件 1.2.42 之前版本存在 PHP 代码注入漏洞。该插件在安装过程中会遗留 installer.php 和 installer-backup.php 等安装文件，远程未认证攻击者可通过直接访问这些残留的安装文件，在数据库配置步骤中向 wp-config.php 注入恶意 PHP 代码，从而实现任意代码执行。攻击无需任何身份验证，利用门槛极低，可完全控制目标站点。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17207"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-19T16:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 Snap Creek Duplicator 插件至 1.2.42 或更高版本。作为临时缓解措施，手动删除服务器上残留的 installer.php 和 installer-backup.php 文件，并检查 wp-config.php 中是否存在恶意 PHP 代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://snapcreek.com/duplicator/docs/changelog/?lite","https://www.synacktiv.com/ressources/advisories/WordPress_Duplicator-1.2.40-RCE.pdf","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17207.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17207.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-17207.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4364d39380ee5ce53a0ba00a4a1f4a27f1df9cc8/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17207.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17207.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-17207.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-17207.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2018-17207.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2018/CVE-2018-17207.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/cb3bd36094377a25dbc2de0dacc69b62a09f7685/nuclei-templates/2018/CVE-2018-17207-duplicator-aff754d6-8624-4068-8e31-738f6041d3a6.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-17207.json","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2018-17207"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0124.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0124.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0115","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16671","title":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife 信息泄露漏洞","description":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife 4.3 之前版本存在信息泄露漏洞。由于 /html/device-id 接口未实施身份认证，未经授权的远程攻击者可直接访问该接口获取系统软件版本、设备标识等敏感信息。攻击者无需任何凭证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可能导致工控系统拓扑信息暴露，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。该漏洞影响 CirCarLife 全系列 4.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16671"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-18T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:39Z","remediation":"立即将 CIRCONTROL CirCarLife 升级至 4.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `/html/device-id` 接口未授权访问问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 Web 服务器层面对 `/html/device-id` 路径添加身份认证或 IP 白名单访问控制，阻止未授权外部请求获取系统设备信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/SadFud/Exploits/tree/master/Real%20World/Suites/cir-pwn-life","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45384/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16671.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16671.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16671.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16671.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16671-3393.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16671-3394.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16671-3391.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16671_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16671.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CirCarLife Scada/CVE-2018-16671.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-16671.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0114","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16670","title":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife SCADA 信息泄露漏洞","description":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife 4.3 之前版本存在信息泄露漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可直接访问 /html/devstat.html 接口，该接口未对请求来源进行身份验证，导致 PLC 设备状态信息被未授权获取。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求获取 PLC 运行状态、设备配置等敏感信息，为后续攻击提供情报支持。该漏洞影响 CirCarLife SCADA 系统，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16670"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-18T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:39Z","remediation":"升级 CirCarLife 至 4.3 或更高版本，该版本已对 /html/devstat.html 等敏感接口添加身份认证机制。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）或网络防火墙上限制对 /html/devstat.html 路径的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 访问，并禁用 Scada 设备的公网暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/SadFud/Exploits/tree/master/Real%20World/Suites/cir-pwn-life","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45384/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16670.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d